      "outcomes": "After completion of the laboratory, the student should be able to\n\nCO-1. Understand the basic manufacturing processes and operations.\n\nCO-2. Use hand tools and equipment safely and efficiently.\n\nCO-3. Perform basic operations in carpentry, fitting, welding, sheet metal work and machining\nCO-4. Read and interpret workshop drawings\n\nCO-5. Develop teamwork, time management and quality awareness in a workshop environment."
