      "referenceBooks": "1. Erwin Kreyszig, Advanced Engineering Mathematics, 9th Edition, John Wiley & Sons, 2006.\n2. G.B. Thomas and R.L. Finney, Calculus and Analytic Geometry, 9th Edition, Pearson, Reprint,2002\n3. N.P. Bali and Manish Goyal, A Textbook of Engineering Mathematics, Laxmi Publications,\nReprint,2008.\n4. H.K. Dass and Er. Rajnish Verma, Higher Engineering Mathematics, S Chand and Company Limited,\nNew Delhi.",
