      "outcomes": "After completion of the Course, the student should be able to\n\nCO-1. Build responsive web pages using HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, and basic JavaScript validation.\nCO-2. Apply advanced JavaScript concepts for dynamic client-side functionality.\n\nCO-3. Develop server-side applications using Node.js and Express.\n\nCO-4. Develop server-side applications using Node.js and Express.\nCO-5. Design and develop a Single Page Application (SPA) using React."
